Putting the entrance to the Gnomish Mines so early in the Dungeon is
sort of unfortunate since characters are rarely ready for the Mines
that early. You'll want to build up a reasonable character before trying
them--a good guideline is about 50 hp and relatively good armor and weapon.
There are 7 levels in the Mines: 3 above the town, the town, and 3 below. At
the bottom you'll find the fabled luckstone, which "holds" your luck. If it's
blessed or uncursed, any good luck you earn yourself is permanent. If it's
uncursed or cursed (yes, I know I listed uncursed twice) bad luck is permanent.
Without the stone, any luck changes eventually wear off.




